  "description": "This is a quick update on a new addition to the Canadian portfolio, aligning with my strategy from Weekly #17. The move strengthens the portfolio in anticipation of potential tariff risks.",
  "body_html": "<p>This is a quick update on a new addition to the Canadian portfolio, aligning with my strategy from <em>Weekly #17</em>. The move strengthens the portfolio in anticipation of potential tariff risks.</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;6e151812-cd21-432e-8042-dbaadbf01bee&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wow—500 subscribers! We hit this milestone faster than expected, and it’s all thanks to you.&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;sm&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Weekly #17: The Tariff Trap: How Short-Term Gains Could Cost the US its Competitive Edge&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:84964221,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;George Atuan, CFA&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Engineer, MBA, CFA and fund manager at Redfox. Sharing insights from 14 years of beating the market, blending deep analysis with real-world experience. Subscribe for actionable investment ideas and strategies.&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5ef53c43-be13-49d8-8e89-dbabf5918eb1_512x512.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2025-02-16T20:49:43.930Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fd73316f-b22d-49d5-a874-155ee8965fb0_1024x1024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/the-tariff-trap&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:157263263,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:0,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Beating the Tide&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02d8d6dc-cded-4940-a95a-dcf5962b8925_176x176.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>Read the details below…</p><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><div><hr></div><p><strong>Trade Alert:</strong> Buy EQX in the SVIF Canada Portfolio.</p><div><hr></div><p>Equinox’s Greenstone mine in Ontario is expected to be a major production driver, targeting up to 390,000 ounces of gold per year. This should enhance the company’s cost structure and cash flow, improving profitability. Additionally, EQX is working toward full ownership of the mine, which could optimize its jurisdictional and cost profile while strengthening its overall valuation.</p><p>Beyond Greenstone, Equinox’s diversified asset base across the Americas positions it well to capitalize on the current bullish trend in gold prices. Increased production combined with favourable market conditions creates a compelling risk-reward setup for long-term upside.</p>",
